                                    <h1>Best Marketing Agency for Ethnic Wear D2C Brands 2026-2027</h1>
                                    <p>Ethnic wear D2C is one of India's most defensible + globally-reaching apparel categories — sarees + kurtas + lehengas + traditional wear + occasion + festival + wedding. FabIndia + BIBA + W + Suta + growing modern D2C ethnic + occasion wear. India domestic + global Indian diaspora (USA + UK + UAE + Canada + Australia). Here is picking a specialist ethnic wear marketing partner.</p>
