                                    <p><strong>Instagram + visual content:</strong> Ethnic wear peak visual + editorial-driven category.<br><strong>Meta ads + retargeting:</strong> Long consideration + retargeting-heavy.<br><strong>Google Search + specific queries:</strong> Occasion + specific-style queries.<br><strong>YouTube + styling content:</strong> Draping + styling + occasion content.<br><strong>Regional creator partnerships:</strong> Regional + occasion-specific creator content.<br><strong>Editorial + wedding content:</strong> Wedding + occasion editorial content.<br><strong>Physical showroom + retail:</strong> Ethnic wear benefits from touch + feel + try-on.<br><strong>WhatsApp + concierge:</strong> Personalised wedding + occasion concierge.</p>
